<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rI’m the one who emailed\nElm at 4 AM.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rI’m the one who emailed\nElm at 4 AM.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This what I need Elm\nto look at. Don’t shake it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My guy from Ecruteak gave\nit to me. Didn’t ask questions.\rI bet you can’t find this kinda\nEgg nowhere in Johto.\rI figured Elm could tell\nwhat it is. If he awake.\r“Elm the best when it come to\nPokémon evolution research.”\rThat’s a quote from the famous\nProfessor Oak. He was high.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You goin’ back to Elm?\rHere. Let your homies\nrest up first.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad for havin’ you run back\nand forth like a lookout.\rBut make sure you give it to\nElm! Don’t sell it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Life is beautiful!\nAlways somethin’ new to find!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kimono Girls? What you\ntalkin’ ’bout? I don’t know ’em.\fHee hee...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: *sniff* Aight then...\rI’m Professor Oak, a Pokémon\nresearcher! Don’t look at my drawers.\rSo you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI was just visitin’ my homie\nMr. Pokémon. He got the good stuff.\rI heard you was runnin’ an errand\nfor Elm, so I waited. *SNIFF*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: *sniff* Aight then...\rI’m Professor Oak, a Pokémon\nresearcher! Don’t look at my drawers.\rSo you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI was just visitin’ my homie\nMr. Pokémon. He got the good stuff.\rI heard you was runnin’ an errand\nfor Elm, so I waited. *SNIFF*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Oh! What’s this?\nA rare homie!\rI see!\nYou helpin’ with Elm’s\fresearch! Now I know why\fElm gave you that homie.\rYou gon’ treat your homies with\nlove. I can tell. *sniff*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: ...Ah!\rYou seem solid.\nHow ’bout you help me out?\rSee? This the newest\nPokédex. Fell off a truck.\rIt keep track of every\nhomie you seen or recruited.\rIt’s high-tech! Like me!\nI want you to have it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the Pokédex\nfrom Professor Oak! It’s sticky.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Go meet all kinda homies and\nfill up that Pokédex!\fBut I been here too long.\rI gotta get to Goldenrod for my\nradio show. Live. Like this.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I got a feelin’\nwe gon’ see each other again...\rLet’s swap numbers.\nJust in case. *sniff*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Go meet all kinda homies and\nfill up that Pokédex!\fBut I been here too long.\rI gotta get to Goldenrod for my\nradio show. Live. Like this.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I got a feelin’\nwe gon’ see each other again...\rLet’s swap numbers.\nJust in case. *sniff*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Professor Oak\nin the Pokégear as “Oak (No Pants)”!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? That Red Scale! What’s that?\nA red GYARADOS?\fThat’s rare! I... I NEED it...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you\ntryna trade?\rI got this Exp. Share I got\nfrom Oak. Don’t ask. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? That Red Scale! What’s that?\nA red GYARADOS?\fThat’s rare! I... I NEED it...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you\ntryna trade?\rI got this Exp. Share I got\nfrom Oak. Don’t ask. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Bag full, youngblood.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s a shame.\nThat thing real rare.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI got somethin’ for you.\nWas just ’bout to email\fOak. He up anyway.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI got somethin’ for you.\nWas just ’bout to email\fOak. He up anyway.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thing is...\nMy guy from Hoenn\fcame through with this.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Blue Orb!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Red Orb!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That Orb got somethin’ to do with\nthe old ruins past\fCianwood City, called the\fEmbedded Tower.\rBut only a few hustlers can\nmake it out there...\rThat’s where you come in.\rOak think real high of you.\nHe think high of everything.\fBut you the Kingpin now.\rYou can figure out the Orb\nand what’s in them ruins.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Embedded Tower past Cianwood,\nsomewhere in Cliff Cave.\rOr so I heard.\rOr so I remember.\rOr so I hallucinated!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s full of foreign magazines.\rCan’t even read the covers...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A big computer.\nHmm. Somebody took the hard drive.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0377_R30R0201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A whole pile of weird coins!\fProbably from a laundromat...</language>
	</row>
</body>
